    "title": "自从 + starting event",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-prepositions-p01-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "自从 + starting event",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "自从 names the starting event of a situation continuing afterward. The following clause must relate to that subsequent interval.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "自从他来了，我就很高兴。",
                "pinyin": "zìcóng tā lái le ， wǒ jiù hěn gāoxìng 。",
                "meaning": "I have been happy since he came.",
                "audio": "bb8268bca13d17b1ea81ffe3c1150ad501f067d4e2470f67df0a1a93bfbdfc03"
              },
              {
                "text": "自从开始学习中文，我每天读书。",
                "pinyin": "zìcóng kāishǐ xuéxí Zhōngwén ， wǒ měi tiān dú shū 。",
                "meaning": "Since starting Chinese, I have read every day.",
                "audio": "881527464f3dd1ccc9de123827cf9afad60057bf4fb2cbd7de2f1427efa7c352"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
